# ==============================================================================
# CONSTITUTION OF THE RUSSIAN FEDERATION — DIGITAL LAW CODEOWNERS (ART. 134–137)
# ==============================================================================
# This file encodes the constitutional entrenchment hierarchy of Chapter 9
# (Articles 134–137) as Git path ownership and mandatory review gates.

# 1. PROTECTED CONSTITUTIONAL KERNEL (Article 135)
# Cannot be amended by the Federal Assembly. Any modification requires convening
# the Constitutional Assembly (Конституционное Собрание) under a Federal
# Constitutional Law (not enacted since 1993) + All-Russian Referendum (>=50%
# turnout, >50% approval).
/chapters/00-preamble.md                  @constitutional-assembly @all-russian-referendum
/chapters/01-fundamentals.md              @constitutional-assembly @all-russian-referendum
/chapters/02-rights-and-freedoms.md       @constitutional-assembly @all-russian-referendum
/chapters/09-amendments-and-revision.md   @constitutional-assembly @all-russian-referendum

# 2. SUBSTANTIVE INSTITUTIONAL CHAPTERS (Article 136)
# Amended via a Law of the RF on Amendment to the Constitution (Закон РФ о поправке
# к Конституции РФ): >=2/3 State Duma + >=3/4 Federation Council + >=2/3 Regional
# Legislatures within 1 year + Presidential signature.
/chapters/03-federal-structure.md         @state-duma-2-3 @federation-council-3-4 @regional-legislatures-2-3 @president-rf
/chapters/04-president.md                 @state-duma-2-3 @federation-council-3-4 @regional-legislatures-2-3 @president-rf
/chapters/05-federal-assembly.md          @state-duma-2-3 @federation-council-3-4 @regional-legislatures-2-3 @president-rf
/chapters/06-government.md                @state-duma-2-3 @federation-council-3-4 @regional-legislatures-2-3 @president-rf
/chapters/07-judiciary-and-prosecution.md @state-duma-2-3 @federation-council-3-4 @regional-legislatures-2-3 @president-rf
/chapters/08-local-self-government.md     @state-duma-2-3 @federation-council-3-4 @regional-legislatures-2-3 @president-rf

